    "updated_at": "2026-09-08T12:15:45Z",
    "body": "Two options:\n\n1. Switch to task timing in RSA. This would align with implementations, but would make media elements inconsistent with `img`'s [update the image data](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#update-the-image-data) step 8, which uses microtask timing (implemented as such in Gecko and Chromium; WebKit appears to be sync, see [test case](https://wpt.fyi/results/html/semantics/embedded-content/the-img-element/update-the-image-data/current-request-microtask.html?label=master&label=experimental&aligned)).\n2. Keep the spec as-is, update implementations to match the spec. This would mean `img` and media elements are more consistent.\n\nThoughts? @whatwg/media ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
